# ============================================================================
# business.http — 任务4 业务端点请求集合 (ЛР2 контракты O-01..O-09)
# 使用方式: 先 POST /api/v1/auth/token 拿 access_token, 替换 {{token}};
#           可在 VS Code REST Client / Postman 中逐段发送。
# ============================================================================

### O-04 学生: 自己的成绩列表
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/grades
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### O-01 学生: 按 ID 查成绩 (把 <grade_id> 换成上面返回的 id)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/grades/<grade_id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### O-03 教师/员工: 修改成绩 (version 必须等于当前版本, 否则 409)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/grades/<grade_id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": 90, "version": 1 }

### O-02 学生: 创建补考申请 (student_id 由服务器决定)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/retake-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "course_id": "<course_id>", "reason": "Не удалось сдать с первого раза, прошу пересдачу" }

### O-06 LLM 检查: 按 ЛР3 例外返回 501
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/retake-requests/<request_id>/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### O-08 课程
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/courses/<course_id>
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### O-05 员工: 确认成绩
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/grades/<grade_id>/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "approve" }

### O-09 员工: 审计日志
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/audit/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
